  "purpose": "FerroScope's own mapping from concept-level mechanism nodes to representative ferroptosis genes, each carrying a deep link to its FerrDb V3 single-gene (pan-RCD) page. This layer exists because the mechanism graph is concept-level while FerrDb is gene-level; it lets a reader jump from a named gene in the interface straight to that gene's FerrDb record.",
  "boundary": "This mapping is FerroScope editorial curation, not FerrDb data. Gene symbols are HGNC facts and the deep-link URLs are constructed by FerroScope. This file deliberately does NOT reproduce any FerrDb curated content: no driver/suppressor/marker labels, no confidence levels and no literature counts are copied here. A gene listed under a node means only that FerroScope considers it a representative member of that mechanism concept; it does not assert how FerrDb classifies that gene. Follow the link to read FerrDb's own, dated, publication-centric record.",
